[2026-03-14T20:48:25.104Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PnquYWZgEanxPzcWrnWktt","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# AirbnbClone - Vacation Rental Marketplace\n     2→\n     3→## Overview\n     4→\n     5→A vacation rental marketplace where hosts can list properties and guests can browse, search, and book stays. The app features property listings with photos, search and filtering, a booking system, user profiles, reviews, and a host dashboard.\n     6→\n     7→## Data Model\n     8→\n     9→### Users\n    10→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    11→- `email` (text, unique, not null)\n    12→- `name` (text, not null)\n    13→- `avatar_url` (text, nullable)\n    14→- `bio` (text, nullable)\n    15→- `phone` (text, nullable)\n    16→- `is_host` (boolean, default false)\n    17→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    18→\n    19→### Properties\n    20→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    21→- `host_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    22→- `title` (text, not null)\n    23→- `description` (text, not null)\n    24→- `property_type` (text, not null) — \"Apartment\", \"House\", \"Cabin\", \"Villa\", \"Condo\", \"Loft\", \"Cottage\", \"Townhouse\"\n    25→- `price_per_night` (numeric, not null)\n    26→- `cleaning_fee` (numeric, default 0)\n    27→- `max_guests` (integer, not null)\n    28→- `bedrooms` (integer, not null)\n    29→- `beds` (integer, not null)\n    30→- `bathrooms` (integer, not null)\n    31→- `address` (text, not null)\n    32→- `city` (text, not null)\n    33→- `state` (text, nullable)\n    34→- `country` (text, not null)\n    35→- `latitude` (numeric, nullable)\n    36→- `longitude` (numeric, nullable)\n    37→- `check_in_time` (text, default '15:00')\n    38→- `check_out_time` (text, default '11:00')\n    39→- `is_active` (boolean, default true)\n    40→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    41→- `updated_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    42→\n    43→### Property Images\n    44→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    45→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    46→- `url` (text, not null)\n    47→- `caption` (text, nullable)\n    48→- `display_order` (integer, default 0)\n    49→\n    50→### Amenities\n    51→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    52→- `name` (text, unique, not null)\n    53→- `icon` (text, nullable)\n    54→- `category` (text, not null) — \"Essentials\", \"Features\", \"Safety\", \"Location\"\n    55→\n    56→### Property Amenities (join table)\n    57→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n    58→- `amenity_id` (UUID, FK → amenities.id)\n    59→- PK: (property_id, amenity_id)\n    60→\n    61→### Bookings\n    62→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    63→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    64→- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    65→- `check_in` (date, not null)\n    66→- `check_out` (date, not null)\n    67→- `num_guests` (integer, not null)\n    68→- `total_price` (numeric, not null)\n    69→- `status` (text, not null) — \"pending\", \"confirmed\", \"cancelled\", \"completed\"\n    70→- `special_requests` (text, nullable)\n    71→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    72→\n    73→### Reviews\n    74→- `id` (UUID, PK)\n    75→- `booking_id` (UUID, FK → bookings.id, unique, not null)\n    76→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id, not null)\n    77→- `guest_id` (UUID, FK → users.id, not null)\n    78→- `rating` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    79→- `cleanliness` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    80→- `accuracy` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    81→- `communication` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    82→- `location` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    83→- `value` (integer, not null, check 1-5)\n    84→- `comment` (text, nullable)\n    85→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    86→\n    87→### Favorites\n    88→- `user_id` (UUID, FK → users.id)\n    89→- `property_id` (UUID, FK → properties.id)\n    90→- `created_at` (timestamp, default now)\n    91→- PK: (user_id, property_id)\n    92→\n    93→## Pages\n    94→\n    95→### 1. Login / Register Page (`/login`)\n    96→- Simple email-based login (no password for simplicity — enter email, get logged in)\n    97→- Registration form with name, email fields\n    98→- Toggle between login and register modes\n    99→- After login, redirect to home page\n   100→- Store current user in Redux state\n   101→\n   102→### 2. Home / Search Page (`/`)\n   103→- **Search bar** at top: location text input, check-in date, check-out date, number of guests\n   104→- **Category filter bar**: horizontal scrollable chips for property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, etc.)\n   105→- **Property grid**: responsive grid of property cards\n   106→  - Each card shows: main image, property type badge, title, city/country, price per night, average rating with review count\n   107→  - Heart icon to favorite/unfavorite (if logged in)\n   108→  - Clicking card navigates to property detail page\n   109→- **Filters panel** (toggle open/close): price range slider, bedrooms min, beds min, bathrooms min, amenity checkboxes\n   110→- Pagination or infinite scroll for results\n   111→\n   112→### 3. Property Detail Page (`/properties/:id`)\n   113→- **Image gallery**: grid layout showing property images (main large image + smaller thumbnails)\n   114→- **Property header**: title, city/country, rating summary, review count, host name with avatar\n   115→- **Property info section**: property type, guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n   116→- **Description**: full property description text\n   117→- **Amenities list**: grouped by category with icons\n   118→- **Booking card** (sticky sidebar on desktop):\n   119→  - Price per night display\n   120→  - Check-in / check-out date pickers\n   121→  - Guest count selector\n   122→  - Price breakdown: nightly rate x nights, cleaning fee, total\n   123→  - \"Reserve\" button (must be logged in, cannot book own property)\n   124→- **Reviews section**: average ratings by category (cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value), individual review cards with guest name, date, rating, comment\n   125→- **Host info card**: host name, avatar, bio, member since date, number of listings\n   126→\n   127→### 4. My Trips Page (`/trips`)\n   128→- Requires login\n   129→- Tabs: \"Upcoming\", \"Past\", \"Cancelled\"\n   130→- Each trip card shows: property image, property title, city, dates, status badge, total price\n   131→- Click trip card to see booking details\n   132→- Cancel button for pending/confirmed bookings (with confirmation dialog)\n   133→- \"Write Review\" button for completed bookings without a review\n   134→\n   135→### 5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)\n   136→- Requires login and host status\n   137→- **Stats overview**: total listings, active bookings, total earnings, average rating\n   138→- **Listings tab**: grid of host's properties with edit/deactivate actions\n   139→- **Bookings tab**: table of bookings for host's properties with status filters\n   140→  - Host can confirm or cancel pending bookings\n   141→- **Add Listing button**: opens a multi-step form to create a new property\n   142→  - Step 1: Property type and title\n   143→  - Step 2: Location (address, city, state, country)\n   144→  - Step 3: Details (guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms)\n   145→  - Step 4: Amenities selection (checkboxes grouped by category)\n   146→  - Step 5: Photos (URL input for image URLs)\n   147→  - Step 6: Pricing (price per night, cleaning fee)\n   148→  - Step 7: Review and publish\n   149→\n   150→### 6. User Profile Page (`/profile`)\n   151→- Requires login\n   152→- View/edit name, bio, phone, avatar URL\n   153→- \"Become a Host\" button (if not already a host)\n   154→- List of user's reviews they've written\n   155→\n   156→### 7. Write Review Page (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)\n   157→- Requires login\n   158→- Rating sliders for: overall, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value\n   159→- Text comment area\n   160→- Submit button\n   161→- Shows property info and booking dates for context\n   162→\n   163→## API Endpoints (Netlify Functions)\n   164→\n   165→### Auth\n   166→- `POST /api/auth` — Login/register by email. Returns user object.\n   167→\n   168→### Users\n   169→- `GET /api/users/:id` — Get user profile\n   170→- `PUT /api/users/:id` — Update user profile\n   171→- `POST /api/users/:id/become-host` — Set is_host to true\n   172→\n   173→### Properties\n   174→- `GET /api/properties` — List properties with search/filter query params (city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, page, limit)\n   175→- `GET /api/properties/:id` — Get property detail with images, amenities, host info\n   176→- `POST /api/properties` — Create property (host only)\n   177→- `PUT /api/properties/:id` — Update property (owner only)\n   178→- `DELETE /api/properties/:id` — Deactivate property (owner only)\n   179→\n   180→### Property Images\n   181→- `POST /api/property-images` — Add image to property\n   182→- `DELETE /api/property-images/:id` — Remove image\n   183→\n   184→### Bookings\n   185→- `GET /api/bookings` — Get current user's bookings (as guest)\n   186→- `GET /api/host-bookings` — Get bookings for host's properties\n   187→- `POST /api/bookings` — Create booking\n   188→- `PUT /api/bookings/:id` — Update booking status (confirm/cancel)\n   189→\n   190→### Reviews\n   191→- `GET /api/reviews?property_id=X` — Get reviews for a property\n   192→- `POST /api/reviews` — Create review for a completed booking\n   193→\n   194→### Favorites\n   195→- `GET /api/favorites` — Get current user's favorites\n   196→- `POST /api/favorites` — Add favorite\n   197→- `DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId` — Remove favorite\n   198→\n   199→### Amenities\n   200→- `GET /api/amenities` — List all amenities\n   201→\n   202→## Visual Design\n   203→\n   204→- Clean, modern design inspired by Airbnb's aesthetic\n   205→- White/light gray background with coral/red accent color (#FF5A5F)\n   206→- Rounded cards with subtle shadows\n   207→- Clean typography using system fonts\n   208→- Responsive layout: 1 column mobile, 2 columns tablet, 3-4 columns desktop for property grid\n   209→- Property cards with rounded corners, image at top, info below\n   210→- Sticky booking sidebar on property detail page (desktop)\n   211→- Collapsible navigation sidebar with icons for: Home/Search, My Trips, Hosting, Profile\n   212→- Star ratings displayed with filled/unfilled stars\n   213→- Status badges: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n   214→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017FNgZEfQUDpMnJrhDek63E","session_id":"8b502c6d-2fab-4348-89e8-3447774cafbf","uuid":"9325b709-fb96-4a45-9090-c5e7c5c8aa0e"}
