[2026-03-14T20:49:07.480Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017FNgZEfQUDpMnJrhDek63E","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive exploration report.\n\n## Comprehensive Airbnb-Clone App Exploration Report\n\nI've thoroughly explored the airbnb-clone application. Here's a detailed summary of the key findings:\n\n---\n\n## 1. App Directory Structure\n\n**Root Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`\n\n**Key Subdirectories:**\n- `/src` — Main React application source\n  - `/pages` — Page components (Home, HostDashboard, PropertyDetail, MyTrips, Profile, WriteReview, Login)\n  - `/components` — Reusable UI components (51 files total)\n  - `/slices` — Redux Toolkit slices for state management (9 files)\n  - `App.tsx`, `main.tsx`, `store.ts`\n- `/netlify/functions` — Serverless functions for API endpoints (12 files)\n- `/tests` — Playwright test specifications (currently 17 test files)\n- `/docs` — `tests.md` (25,000+ lines with full test specifications)\n- `playwright.config.ts` — Playwright configuration\n- `AppSpec.md` — Application specification with data model and API docs\n\n---\n\n## 2. Host Dashboard Test Specifications (from `/docs/tests.md`, lines 747-1090)\n\n**Location:** `/hosting` route\n\n**Components:** StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, AddListingForm\n\n### Key Test Categories:\n\n#### A. Authentication & Authorization\n- **Test:** Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- **Test:** Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts with link to `/profile`\n\n#### B. StatsOverview Component (4 stat cards)\n1. **Total Listings** — Count of active properties (is_active = true)\n2. **Active Bookings** — Count of pending + confirmed bookings for host's properties\n3. **Total Earnings** — Sum of completed booking total_price values (formatted as currency)\n4. **Average Rating** — Average of all review ratings across host's properties, rounded to 1 decimal (or \"—\" if no reviews)\n\n#### C. ListingsTab Component\n- Grid display of host's properties\n- Each card shows: image, title, city, price/night, rating+review count, Active/Inactive badge\n- Actions per property:\n  - **Edit button** — navigates to `/properties/{id}`\n  - **Deactivate button** (for active properties) — shows confirmation dialog, calls `DELETE /api/properties/:id`\n  - **Activate button** (for inactive properties) — calls `PUT /api/properties/:id` with `is_active: true`\n- **Empty state** — \"You don't have any listings yet\" + \"Add Your First Listing\" button\n- **Add Listing button** — Opens multi-step form modal\n\n#### D. BookingsTab Component\n- **Table layout** with columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- **Status filters:** All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed (default: All)\n- **Status badge colors:** \n  - Pending = yellow\n  - Confirmed = green\n  - Cancelled = red\n  - Completed = blue\n- **Actions:**\n  - Pending bookings: \"Confirm\" button + \"Cancel\" button\n  - Confirmed bookings: \"Cancel\" button only\n  - Completed/Cancelled: No action buttons\n- **Cancel booking confirmation dialog** — Shows property title, guest name, check-in/check-out dates\n- **Empty state** — \"No bookings yet\" or \"No [status] bookings\"\n\n#### E. AddListingForm Component (7-step form)\n- **Step 1:** Property type (dropdown) + Title (text input)\n- **Step 2:** Location — Address (with autocomplete via Nominatim API), City, State, Country\n- **Step 3:** Details — Max guests, Bedrooms, Beds, Bathrooms (with increment/decrement controls)\n- **Step 4:** Amenities — Checkboxes grouped by category (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n- **Step 5:** Photos — URL input + \"Add Photo\" button, photo grid with remove buttons\n- **Step 6:** Pricing — Price per night, Cleaning fee (with $ prefix)\n- **Step 7:** Review & Publish — Summary of all data, \"Publish\" button\n- **Navigation:** Step indicator (Step X of 7), Back/Next/Cancel buttons, data persistence across steps\n- **Validation:** Required fields per step, at least 1 photo required, price > 0\n- **On Publish:** POST to `/api/properties`, then POST multiple `/api/property-images` entries\n\n---\n\n## 3. Host Dashboard Page Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx` (157 lines)\n\n**Key Implementation Details:**\n- Checks authentication: redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- Checks host status: shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n- Uses Redux hooks to dispatch:\n  - `fetchHostStats(userId)`\n  - `fetchHostListings(userId)`\n  - `fetchHostBookings(userId)`\n- Manages active tab state (listings/bookings)\n- Manages \"show add form\" state\n- Provides callbacks: `onDeactivate`, `onActivate`, `onConfirmBooking`, `onCancelBooking`, `onAddListingSuccess`\n- **Test IDs:** `host-dashboard`, `tab-listings`, `tab-bookings`, `become-host-link`\n\n---\n\n## 4. Related Components\n\n### StatsOverview (`/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx`)\n- Displays 4 stat cards in responsive grid (1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 4 col desktop)\n- Loading state with animated skeleton placeholders\n- Star icon for average rating (when reviews exist)\n- **Test IDs:** `stats-overview`, `stat-total-listings`, `stat-active-bookings`, `stat-total-earnings`, `stat-average-rating`\n\n### ListingsTab (`/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx`)\n- Grid layout (1-3 columns responsive)\n- Deactivate dialog with confirmation\n- Loading states for async operations\n- Property status badge shows Active/Inactive\n- **Test IDs:** `listings-tab`, `add-listing-button`, `listings-empty-state`, `listing-card-{id}`, `listing-status-{id}`, `listing-edit-{id}`, `listing-deactivate-{id}`, `listing-activate-{id}`, `deactivate-dialog`, `deactivate-dialog-cancel`, `deactivate-dialog-confirm`\n\n### BookingsTab (`/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`)\n- Responsive table with horizontal scroll\n- Status filter buttons with active state styling\n- Status badge mapping to color classes\n- Cancel booking dialog\n- Format dates as \"MMM D, YYYY\"\n- **Test IDs:** `bookings-tab`, `booking-filter-{status}`, `bookings-table`, `booking-row-{id}`, `booking-status-{id}`, `booking-confirm-{id}`, `booking-cancel-{id}`, `bookings-empty-state`, `cancel-booking-dialog`, `cancel-booking-dialog-dismiss`, `cancel-booking-dialog-confirm`\n\n### AddListingForm (`/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx` - 500+ lines)\n- Uses Nominatim OpenStreetMap API for address autocomplete\n- Manages 7-step form state with validation\n- Amenities fetched from Redux (amenitiesSlice)\n- Photos stored in state as array of {url, caption}\n- Property types hardcoded: Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Publishes property then uploads images\n- **Test IDs:** `add-listing-step-{1-7}`, `step-indicator`, `property-type-select`, `property-type-option-{type}`, `listing-title-input`, `listing-address-input`, `address-suggestions`, `listing-city-input`, etc.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Netlify Functions (API Endpoints)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n### host-stats.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-stats?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"totalListings\": number,\n  \"activeBookings\": number,\n  \"totalEarnings\": number,\n  \"avgRating\": number,\n  \"reviewCount\": number\n}\n```\n**Queries:**\n- Total listings: COUNT from properties WHERE host_id = ? AND is_active = true\n- Active bookings: COUNT from bookings WHERE property_id in host's properties AND status IN ('pending', 'confirmed')\n- Total earnings: SUM of completed booking total_price\n- Avg rating: AVG of review ratings for host's properties\n\n### host-listings.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-listings?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:** Array of Property objects with:\n- All property fields\n- main_image (first image by display_order)\n- avg_rating (AVG of reviews)\n- review_count (COUNT of reviews)\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n### host-bookings.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:** Array of HostBooking objects with:\n- All booking fields\n- property_title, property_city, property_country\n- property_image (first image by display_order)\n- guest_name, guest_email (from users table)\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n### properties.ts (Create, Update, Deactivate)\n**POST /api/properties** — Creates property\n- Returns created property object\n- Amenity associations created separately in property_amenities table\n\n**PUT /api/properties/:id** — Updates property (is_active, title, description, price_per_night, cleaning_fee)\n\n**DELETE /api/properties/:id** — Sets is_active = false (soft delete)\n\n### bookings.ts (Update Status)\n**PUT /api/bookings/:id** — Updates booking status\n- Accepts status: 'confirmed' | 'cancelled'\n- Used by host to confirm/cancel bookings\n\n---\n\n## 6. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Settings:**\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test, 10 seconds for expect assertions\n- Workers: 1 (serial execution, no parallelization)\n- WebServer: `netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n- Reporter: ReplayIO (for debugging), JSON, HTML\n- Fully parallel: false\n- Retries: 0\n- Devices: Replay Chromium\n\n---\n\n## 7. Existing Test Files (Reference)\n\n**17 test files in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`:**\n1. `auth.spec.ts` — Login/Register toggle, form validation\n2. `booking-card.spec.ts` — Price breakdown, date/guest selection, reservation\n3. `search.spec.ts` — Search bar functionality\n4. `category-filter.spec.ts` — Property type filtering\n5. `property-grid.spec.ts` — Grid display and messaging\n6. `favorite-button.spec.ts` — Add/remove favorites\n7. `filters-panel.spec.ts` — Price, amenity, bedroom filters\n8. `pagination.spec.ts` — Page navigation\n9. `image-gallery.spec.ts` — Photo display and switching\n10. `property-detail.spec.ts` — Property info display\n11. `reviews-section.spec.ts` — Review display and ratings\n12. `amenities-list.spec.ts` — Grouped amenity display\n13. `host-info-card.spec.ts` — Host profile card\n14. `my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` — Trip categorization\n15. `my-trips-cards.spec.ts` — Trip card details\n16. `my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` — Booking cancellation\n17. `my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` — Review order verification\n\n**Test Pattern:** Each test uses `test.describe()` for organization, `async ({ page })` for Playwright page fixture, `await page.goto()` for navigation, `getByTestId()` for element selection, `expect()` assertions.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Database Schema (from AppSpec.md & Function Implementations)\n\n**Key Tables Relevant to Host Dashboard:**\n\n### users\n- id (UUID), email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n\n### properties\n- id (UUID), host_id (FK), title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee\n- max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n- address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude\n- is_active (boolean, default true), created_at, updated_at\n\n### bookings\n- id (UUID), property_id (FK), guest_id (FK)\n- check_in (date), check_out (date), num_guests\n- total_price, status ('pending'|'confirmed'|'cancelled'|'completed')\n- special_requests, created_at\n\n### reviews\n- id (UUID), booking_id (FK, unique), property_id (FK), guest_id (FK)\n- rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value (1-5)\n- comment, created_at\n\n### property_images\n- id (UUID), property_id (FK), url, caption, display_order\n\n### amenities & property_amenities\n- Join table for many-to-many relationship\n- Categories: Essentials, Features, Safety, Location\n\n---\n\n## 9. Redux Store (State Management)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n\n**Slices:** 11 total\n- `auth` — Current user, login state\n- `host` — **Host-specific:** stats, listings, bookings, loading states\n- `properties` — Search results, filters\n- `favorites` — User favorites\n- `amenities` — Available amenities\n- `propertyDetail` — Single property details\n- `bookings` — Guest bookings (from /api/bookings)\n- `userReviews` — User's written reviews\n- `reviewForm` — Review submission form state\n\n### hostSlice (`/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` - 268 lines)\n\n**State Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface HostState {\n  stats: HostStats\n  listings: Property[]\n  bookings: HostBooking[]\n  statsLoading: boolean\n  listingsLoading: boolean\n  bookingsLoading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n\ninterface HostBooking {\n  id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests, created_at\n  property_title?, property_city?, property_country?, property_image?\n  guest_name?, guest_email?\n}\n\ninterface HostStats {\n  totalListings: number\n  activeBookings: number\n  totalEarnings: number\n  avgRating: number\n  reviewCount: number\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchHostStats(hostId)` — GET /api/host-stats\n- `fetchHostListings(hostId)` — GET /api/host-listings\n- `fetchHostBookings(hostId)` — GET /api/host-bookings\n- `createProperty(propertyData)` — POST /api/properties\n- `deactivateProperty(propertyId)` — DELETE /api/properties/:id (sets is_active=false)\n- `activateProperty(propertyId)` — PUT /api/properties/:id with {is_active:true}\n- `updateHostBookingStatus({bookingId, status})` — PUT /api/bookings/:id\n\n**Extra Reducers:**\n- Thunk lifecycle handlers for pending/fulfilled/rejected states\n- Stats update logic: decrement activeBookings on cancellation, increment on confirmation\n- Listings update: remove from count on deactivate, add on activate\n\n---\n\n## 10. Router Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\n```typescript\nRoutes:\n- /login → Login component\n- / → Home component\n- /properties/:id → PropertyDetail component\n- /trips → MyTrips component\n- /trips/:bookingId/review → WriteReview component\n- /hosting → HostDashboard component  ← KEY\n- /profile → Profile component\n```\n\n---\n\n## 11. Key Implementation Files (Summary)\n\n| File | Purpose | Lines |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| `/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx` | Main page component | 157 |\n| `/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx` | Stats cards display | 75 |\n| `/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx` | Listings grid + deactivate | 225 |\n| `/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` | Bookings table + filters | 207 |\n| `/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx` | 7-step form | 500+ |\n| `/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` | Redux host state | 268 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-stats.ts` | Stats API | 62 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-listings.ts` | Listings API | 29 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts` | Bookings API | 31 |\n| `/docs/tests.md` | Full test specifications | 25,000+ lines |\n\n---\n\n## Key Data Flow Summary\n\n```\nHostDashboard Page\n├── Dispatches: fetchHostStats, fetchHostListings, fetchHostBookings\n├── StatsOverview Component (receives stats)\n├── Tab Navigation (listings/bookings)\n│   ├── ListingsTab (receives listings array)\n│   │   ├── Maps over listings\n│   │   ├── Edit button → /properties/:id\n│   │   ├── Deactivate → Dialog → deactivateProperty thunk\n│   │   ├── Activate → activateProperty thunk\n│   │   └── Add Listing → ShowAddForm = true\n│   │\n│   └── BookingsTab (receives bookings array)\n│       ├── Status filter (pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed)\n│       ├── Table rows with property + guest details\n│       ├── Confirm button → updateHostBookingStatus('confirmed')\n│       └── Cancel button → Dialog → updateHostBookingStatus('cancelled')\n│\n└── AddListingForm Modal\n    ├── 7-step form with validation\n    ├── Step 2 uses Nominatim API for address autocomplete\n    ├── Publishes: createProperty thunk → POST /api/properties\n    └── Then uploads: POST /api/property-images for each photo\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Test Scenarios to Implement\n\nBased on `/docs/tests.md` lines 747-1090, key test scenarios include:\n\n1. **Authentication**: Redirect to login if not authenticated\n2. **Host Status**: Show upgrade prompt if not a host\n3. **Stats Accuracy**: Verify all 4 stats calculate correctly\n4. **Listings Actions**: Edit, Deactivate, Activate with proper dialogs\n5. **Bookings Table**: Filter by status, confirm/cancel with dialogs\n6. **Add Listing Form**: All 7 steps with validation, data persistence\n7. **Empty States**: Show proper messaging for no listings/bookings\n8. **Tab Switching**: Preserve state when switching tabs\n9. **Loading States**: Show spinners during API calls\n10. **Repeated Use**: Ensure all interactions work multiple times\n\n---\n\nAll code paths, component hierarchies, API contracts, state management patterns, and test infrastructure are now fully documented above. The test specifications in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` lines 747-1090 provide the complete requirement details for the Host Dashboard feature."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: aabb23c56ee7e950c (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 78763\ntool_uses: 36\nduration_ms: 92370</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b502c6d-2fab-4348-89e8-3447774cafbf","uuid":"29a10cc8-e34b-495a-99db-d907c3570d58","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the airbnb-clone app thoroughly. I need to understand:\n\n1. The app directory structure (ls apps/airbnb-clone/ and key subdirectories)\n2. The test spec file (docs/tests.md or similar) - specifically the Host Dashboard section\n3. The Host Dashboard page component and any related components\n4. The Netlify functions related to host dashboard (properties, bookings, stats)\n5. The Playwright config\n6. Any existing test files for reference\n7. The database schema/seed files\n8. The router configuration to understand URL paths\n9. The Redux store slices related to host dashboard\n\nBe very thorough - read all host dashboard related components, the test spec entries for Host Dashboard, and any relevant API functions.","agentId":"aabb23c56ee7e950c","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive exploration report.\n\n## Comprehensive Airbnb-Clone App Exploration Report\n\nI've thoroughly explored the airbnb-clone application. Here's a detailed summary of the key findings:\n\n---\n\n## 1. App Directory Structure\n\n**Root Directory:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/`\n\n**Key Subdirectories:**\n- `/src` — Main React application source\n  - `/pages` — Page components (Home, HostDashboard, PropertyDetail, MyTrips, Profile, WriteReview, Login)\n  - `/components` — Reusable UI components (51 files total)\n  - `/slices` — Redux Toolkit slices for state management (9 files)\n  - `App.tsx`, `main.tsx`, `store.ts`\n- `/netlify/functions` — Serverless functions for API endpoints (12 files)\n- `/tests` — Playwright test specifications (currently 17 test files)\n- `/docs` — `tests.md` (25,000+ lines with full test specifications)\n- `playwright.config.ts` — Playwright configuration\n- `AppSpec.md` — Application specification with data model and API docs\n\n---\n\n## 2. Host Dashboard Test Specifications (from `/docs/tests.md`, lines 747-1090)\n\n**Location:** `/hosting` route\n\n**Components:** StatsOverview, ListingsTab, BookingsTab, AddListingForm\n\n### Key Test Categories:\n\n#### A. Authentication & Authorization\n- **Test:** Host Dashboard requires login — redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- **Test:** Host Dashboard requires host status — shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts with link to `/profile`\n\n#### B. StatsOverview Component (4 stat cards)\n1. **Total Listings** — Count of active properties (is_active = true)\n2. **Active Bookings** — Count of pending + confirmed bookings for host's properties\n3. **Total Earnings** — Sum of completed booking total_price values (formatted as currency)\n4. **Average Rating** — Average of all review ratings across host's properties, rounded to 1 decimal (or \"—\" if no reviews)\n\n#### C. ListingsTab Component\n- Grid display of host's properties\n- Each card shows: image, title, city, price/night, rating+review count, Active/Inactive badge\n- Actions per property:\n  - **Edit button** — navigates to `/properties/{id}`\n  - **Deactivate button** (for active properties) — shows confirmation dialog, calls `DELETE /api/properties/:id`\n  - **Activate button** (for inactive properties) — calls `PUT /api/properties/:id` with `is_active: true`\n- **Empty state** — \"You don't have any listings yet\" + \"Add Your First Listing\" button\n- **Add Listing button** — Opens multi-step form modal\n\n#### D. BookingsTab Component\n- **Table layout** with columns: Property, Guest, Check-in, Check-out, Guests, Total, Status, Actions\n- **Status filters:** All, Pending, Confirmed, Cancelled, Completed (default: All)\n- **Status badge colors:** \n  - Pending = yellow\n  - Confirmed = green\n  - Cancelled = red\n  - Completed = blue\n- **Actions:**\n  - Pending bookings: \"Confirm\" button + \"Cancel\" button\n  - Confirmed bookings: \"Cancel\" button only\n  - Completed/Cancelled: No action buttons\n- **Cancel booking confirmation dialog** — Shows property title, guest name, check-in/check-out dates\n- **Empty state** — \"No bookings yet\" or \"No [status] bookings\"\n\n#### E. AddListingForm Component (7-step form)\n- **Step 1:** Property type (dropdown) + Title (text input)\n- **Step 2:** Location — Address (with autocomplete via Nominatim API), City, State, Country\n- **Step 3:** Details — Max guests, Bedrooms, Beds, Bathrooms (with increment/decrement controls)\n- **Step 4:** Amenities — Checkboxes grouped by category (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location)\n- **Step 5:** Photos — URL input + \"Add Photo\" button, photo grid with remove buttons\n- **Step 6:** Pricing — Price per night, Cleaning fee (with $ prefix)\n- **Step 7:** Review & Publish — Summary of all data, \"Publish\" button\n- **Navigation:** Step indicator (Step X of 7), Back/Next/Cancel buttons, data persistence across steps\n- **Validation:** Required fields per step, at least 1 photo required, price > 0\n- **On Publish:** POST to `/api/properties`, then POST multiple `/api/property-images` entries\n\n---\n\n## 3. Host Dashboard Page Component\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx` (157 lines)\n\n**Key Implementation Details:**\n- Checks authentication: redirects unauthenticated users to `/login`\n- Checks host status: shows upgrade prompt for non-hosts\n- Uses Redux hooks to dispatch:\n  - `fetchHostStats(userId)`\n  - `fetchHostListings(userId)`\n  - `fetchHostBookings(userId)`\n- Manages active tab state (listings/bookings)\n- Manages \"show add form\" state\n- Provides callbacks: `onDeactivate`, `onActivate`, `onConfirmBooking`, `onCancelBooking`, `onAddListingSuccess`\n- **Test IDs:** `host-dashboard`, `tab-listings`, `tab-bookings`, `become-host-link`\n\n---\n\n## 4. Related Components\n\n### StatsOverview (`/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx`)\n- Displays 4 stat cards in responsive grid (1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 4 col desktop)\n- Loading state with animated skeleton placeholders\n- Star icon for average rating (when reviews exist)\n- **Test IDs:** `stats-overview`, `stat-total-listings`, `stat-active-bookings`, `stat-total-earnings`, `stat-average-rating`\n\n### ListingsTab (`/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx`)\n- Grid layout (1-3 columns responsive)\n- Deactivate dialog with confirmation\n- Loading states for async operations\n- Property status badge shows Active/Inactive\n- **Test IDs:** `listings-tab`, `add-listing-button`, `listings-empty-state`, `listing-card-{id}`, `listing-status-{id}`, `listing-edit-{id}`, `listing-deactivate-{id}`, `listing-activate-{id}`, `deactivate-dialog`, `deactivate-dialog-cancel`, `deactivate-dialog-confirm`\n\n### BookingsTab (`/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx`)\n- Responsive table with horizontal scroll\n- Status filter buttons with active state styling\n- Status badge mapping to color classes\n- Cancel booking dialog\n- Format dates as \"MMM D, YYYY\"\n- **Test IDs:** `bookings-tab`, `booking-filter-{status}`, `bookings-table`, `booking-row-{id}`, `booking-status-{id}`, `booking-confirm-{id}`, `booking-cancel-{id}`, `bookings-empty-state`, `cancel-booking-dialog`, `cancel-booking-dialog-dismiss`, `cancel-booking-dialog-confirm`\n\n### AddListingForm (`/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx` - 500+ lines)\n- Uses Nominatim OpenStreetMap API for address autocomplete\n- Manages 7-step form state with validation\n- Amenities fetched from Redux (amenitiesSlice)\n- Photos stored in state as array of {url, caption}\n- Property types hardcoded: Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse\n- Publishes property then uploads images\n- **Test IDs:** `add-listing-step-{1-7}`, `step-indicator`, `property-type-select`, `property-type-option-{type}`, `listing-title-input`, `listing-address-input`, `address-suggestions`, `listing-city-input`, etc.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Netlify Functions (API Endpoints)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n### host-stats.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-stats?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:**\n```json\n{\n  \"totalListings\": number,\n  \"activeBookings\": number,\n  \"totalEarnings\": number,\n  \"avgRating\": number,\n  \"reviewCount\": number\n}\n```\n**Queries:**\n- Total listings: COUNT from properties WHERE host_id = ? AND is_active = true\n- Active bookings: COUNT from bookings WHERE property_id in host's properties AND status IN ('pending', 'confirmed')\n- Total earnings: SUM of completed booking total_price\n- Avg rating: AVG of review ratings for host's properties\n\n### host-listings.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-listings?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:** Array of Property objects with:\n- All property fields\n- main_image (first image by display_order)\n- avg_rating (AVG of reviews)\n- review_count (COUNT of reviews)\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n### host-bookings.ts\n```\nGET /api/host-bookings?host_id={hostId}\n```\n**Response:** Array of HostBooking objects with:\n- All booking fields\n- property_title, property_city, property_country\n- property_image (first image by display_order)\n- guest_name, guest_email (from users table)\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n### properties.ts (Create, Update, Deactivate)\n**POST /api/properties** — Creates property\n- Returns created property object\n- Amenity associations created separately in property_amenities table\n\n**PUT /api/properties/:id** — Updates property (is_active, title, description, price_per_night, cleaning_fee)\n\n**DELETE /api/properties/:id** — Sets is_active = false (soft delete)\n\n### bookings.ts (Update Status)\n**PUT /api/bookings/:id** — Updates booking status\n- Accepts status: 'confirmed' | 'cancelled'\n- Used by host to confirm/cancel bookings\n\n---\n\n## 6. Playwright Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n**Key Settings:**\n- Test directory: `./tests`\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Timeout: 60 seconds per test, 10 seconds for expect assertions\n- Workers: 1 (serial execution, no parallelization)\n- WebServer: `netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions`\n- Reporter: ReplayIO (for debugging), JSON, HTML\n- Fully parallel: false\n- Retries: 0\n- Devices: Replay Chromium\n\n---\n\n## 7. Existing Test Files (Reference)\n\n**17 test files in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`:**\n1. `auth.spec.ts` — Login/Register toggle, form validation\n2. `booking-card.spec.ts` — Price breakdown, date/guest selection, reservation\n3. `search.spec.ts` — Search bar functionality\n4. `category-filter.spec.ts` — Property type filtering\n5. `property-grid.spec.ts` — Grid display and messaging\n6. `favorite-button.spec.ts` — Add/remove favorites\n7. `filters-panel.spec.ts` — Price, amenity, bedroom filters\n8. `pagination.spec.ts` — Page navigation\n9. `image-gallery.spec.ts` — Photo display and switching\n10. `property-detail.spec.ts` — Property info display\n11. `reviews-section.spec.ts` — Review display and ratings\n12. `amenities-list.spec.ts` — Grouped amenity display\n13. `host-info-card.spec.ts` — Host profile card\n14. `my-trips-tabs.spec.ts` — Trip categorization\n15. `my-trips-cards.spec.ts` — Trip card details\n16. `my-trips-cancel-dialog.spec.ts` — Booking cancellation\n17. `my-trips-review-order.spec.ts` — Review order verification\n\n**Test Pattern:** Each test uses `test.describe()` for organization, `async ({ page })` for Playwright page fixture, `await page.goto()` for navigation, `getByTestId()` for element selection, `expect()` assertions.\n\n---\n\n## 8. Database Schema (from AppSpec.md & Function Implementations)\n\n**Key Tables Relevant to Host Dashboard:**\n\n### users\n- id (UUID), email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n\n### properties\n- id (UUID), host_id (FK), title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee\n- max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms\n- address, city, state, country, latitude, longitude\n- is_active (boolean, default true), created_at, updated_at\n\n### bookings\n- id (UUID), property_id (FK), guest_id (FK)\n- check_in (date), check_out (date), num_guests\n- total_price, status ('pending'|'confirmed'|'cancelled'|'completed')\n- special_requests, created_at\n\n### reviews\n- id (UUID), booking_id (FK, unique), property_id (FK), guest_id (FK)\n- rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value (1-5)\n- comment, created_at\n\n### property_images\n- id (UUID), property_id (FK), url, caption, display_order\n\n### amenities & property_amenities\n- Join table for many-to-many relationship\n- Categories: Essentials, Features, Safety, Location\n\n---\n\n## 9. Redux Store (State Management)\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n\n**Slices:** 11 total\n- `auth` — Current user, login state\n- `host` — **Host-specific:** stats, listings, bookings, loading states\n- `properties` — Search results, filters\n- `favorites` — User favorites\n- `amenities` — Available amenities\n- `propertyDetail` — Single property details\n- `bookings` — Guest bookings (from /api/bookings)\n- `userReviews` — User's written reviews\n- `reviewForm` — Review submission form state\n\n### hostSlice (`/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` - 268 lines)\n\n**State Structure:**\n```typescript\ninterface HostState {\n  stats: HostStats\n  listings: Property[]\n  bookings: HostBooking[]\n  statsLoading: boolean\n  listingsLoading: boolean\n  bookingsLoading: boolean\n  error: string | null\n}\n\ninterface HostBooking {\n  id, property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price\n  status: 'pending' | 'confirmed' | 'cancelled' | 'completed'\n  special_requests, created_at\n  property_title?, property_city?, property_country?, property_image?\n  guest_name?, guest_email?\n}\n\ninterface HostStats {\n  totalListings: number\n  activeBookings: number\n  totalEarnings: number\n  avgRating: number\n  reviewCount: number\n}\n```\n\n**Async Thunks:**\n- `fetchHostStats(hostId)` — GET /api/host-stats\n- `fetchHostListings(hostId)` — GET /api/host-listings\n- `fetchHostBookings(hostId)` — GET /api/host-bookings\n- `createProperty(propertyData)` — POST /api/properties\n- `deactivateProperty(propertyId)` — DELETE /api/properties/:id (sets is_active=false)\n- `activateProperty(propertyId)` — PUT /api/properties/:id with {is_active:true}\n- `updateHostBookingStatus({bookingId, status})` — PUT /api/bookings/:id\n\n**Extra Reducers:**\n- Thunk lifecycle handlers for pending/fulfilled/rejected states\n- Stats update logic: decrement activeBookings on cancellation, increment on confirmation\n- Listings update: remove from count on deactivate, add on activate\n\n---\n\n## 10. Router Configuration\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n\n```typescript\nRoutes:\n- /login → Login component\n- / → Home component\n- /properties/:id → PropertyDetail component\n- /trips → MyTrips component\n- /trips/:bookingId/review → WriteReview component\n- /hosting → HostDashboard component  ← KEY\n- /profile → Profile component\n```\n\n---\n\n## 11. Key Implementation Files (Summary)\n\n| File | Purpose | Lines |\n|------|---------|-------|\n| `/src/pages/HostDashboard.tsx` | Main page component | 157 |\n| `/src/components/StatsOverview.tsx` | Stats cards display | 75 |\n| `/src/components/ListingsTab.tsx` | Listings grid + deactivate | 225 |\n| `/src/components/BookingsTab.tsx` | Bookings table + filters | 207 |\n| `/src/components/AddListingForm.tsx` | 7-step form | 500+ |\n| `/src/slices/hostSlice.ts` | Redux host state | 268 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-stats.ts` | Stats API | 62 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-listings.ts` | Listings API | 29 |\n| `/netlify/functions/host-bookings.ts` | Bookings API | 31 |\n| `/docs/tests.md` | Full test specifications | 25,000+ lines |\n\n---\n\n## Key Data Flow Summary\n\n```\nHostDashboard Page\n├── Dispatches: fetchHostStats, fetchHostListings, fetchHostBookings\n├── StatsOverview Component (receives stats)\n├── Tab Navigation (listings/bookings)\n│   ├── ListingsTab (receives listings array)\n│   │   ├── Maps over listings\n│   │   ├── Edit button → /properties/:id\n│   │   ├── Deactivate → Dialog → deactivateProperty thunk\n│   │   ├── Activate → activateProperty thunk\n│   │   └── Add Listing → ShowAddForm = true\n│   │\n│   └── BookingsTab (receives bookings array)\n│       ├── Status filter (pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed)\n│       ├── Table rows with property + guest details\n│       ├── Confirm button → updateHostBookingStatus('confirmed')\n│       └── Cancel button → Dialog → updateHostBookingStatus('cancelled')\n│\n└── AddListingForm Modal\n    ├── 7-step form with validation\n    ├── Step 2 uses Nominatim API for address autocomplete\n    ├── Publishes: createProperty thunk → POST /api/properties\n    └── Then uploads: POST /api/property-images for each photo\n```\n\n---\n\n## Critical Test Scenarios to Implement\n\nBased on `/docs/tests.md` lines 747-1090, key test scenarios include:\n\n1. **Authentication**: Redirect to login if not authenticated\n2. **Host Status**: Show upgrade prompt if not a host\n3. **Stats Accuracy**: Verify all 4 stats calculate correctly\n4. **Listings Actions**: Edit, Deactivate, Activate with proper dialogs\n5. **Bookings Table**: Filter by status, confirm/cancel with dialogs\n6. **Add Listing Form**: All 7 steps with validation, data persistence\n7. **Empty States**: Show proper messaging for no listings/bookings\n8. **Tab Switching**: Preserve state when switching tabs\n9. **Loading States**: Show spinners during API calls\n10. **Repeated Use**: Ensure all interactions work multiple times\n\n---\n\nAll code paths, component hierarchies, API contracts, state management patterns, and test infrastructure are now fully documented above. The test specifications in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` lines 747-1090 provide the complete requirement details for the Host Dashboard feature."}],"totalDurationMs":92370,"totalTokens":78763,"totalToolUseCount":36,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5876,"cache_read_input_tokens":67953,"output_tokens":4934,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5876},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
